1
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:19,560
Mr. Lu,

2
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:21,000
there's a bit of a traffic jam today.

3
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,040
The driver is stuck on the overpass.

4
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:25,760
I'm driving Mr. Liu's car in the underground parking lot.

5
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,120
Please wait for me a moment.

6
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,720
Do you know Zhou Jian from the Merchandise Department?

7
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,000
I know him,

8
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,960
but not very well.

9
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,200
Does he have a girlfriend?

10
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,880
Because we're not very close,

11
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,520
I'm not sure about this.

12
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,680
I saw you talking to him in the hallway that day.

13
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,000
Did he do something wrong?

14
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,560
I'll notify HR to terminate his employment tomorrow.

15
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:44,120
Ah.

16
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,000
No need.

17
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,320
He's quite good.

18
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,640
You go get the car first.

19
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:50,480
Okay.

20
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,200
I know.

21
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,160
By the way,

22
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:55,160
don't tell Zhou Jian who I am.

23
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,120
Mr. Lu,

24
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:56,920
I know.

25
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,160
It's raining heavily.

26
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:24,440
Hard to get a car off the roadside.

27
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,840
Your department is off work.

28
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:27,960
Why are you still here?

29
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,720
I just finished the files in hand.

30
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,240
You are so hard-working.

31
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,920
I have to.

32
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:41,280
If only I could be department manager.

33
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,440
After all, I'm not like you.

34
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,760
You have a good family background,

35
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,520
which is different from me.

36
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,640
How do you know my family background is good?

37
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,560
You are an intern.

38
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,600
I guess your half-year salary

39
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,280
plus overtime pay can't afford this dress.

40
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,880
You can't afford it.

41
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:14,880
I don't need it.

42
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,480
I borrowed it from you.

43
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,960
Return it to me tomorrow.

44
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,360
Oh,

45
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:30,200
don't wear such expensive clothes to work again.

46
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,760
If that crazy woman sees you,

47
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,720
it could be dangerous.

48
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,760
Good evening, everyone.

49
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:54,760
Let's start tonight's Golden Thread

50
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:58,080
honorary moment with the warmest applause.

51
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,720
The annual promotion commendation banquet

52
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,880
now officially begins.

53
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,480
Why is the protagonist of the celebration

54
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,840
drinking alone here?

55
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,560
I'm not the star here.

56
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:18,080
Fu Xin is.

57
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:23,120
Someone like me, who can only afford

58
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,000
a cheap suit with overtime pay,

59
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,000
is just a background.

60
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,080
Who's Fu Xin?

61
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,880
I've never seen his name in the financial reports.

62
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,600
It's normal that you don't know him.

63
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,920
I'm his colleague,

64
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,720
but I've barely seen him.

65
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,600
He's the royalty of the Group.

66
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:48,280
Mr. Liu wants to use him as a bridge.

67
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:52,080
After all, the orders from his uncle

68
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:55,560
are enough to sustain our department for years.

69
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,520
Let's welcome Ms. Lu Qianqian

70
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:01,960
to read this list of honor for us.

71
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,440
Just say it.

72
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,920
President Lu, it's your turn to present the award to Mr. Fu.

73
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:28,080
Are you Lu Qianqian, the daughter of the chairman?

74
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:29,840
Yes.

75
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,520
Are you the woman who

76
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:36,200
who poured wine on someone for wearing the same dress,

77
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:38,240
and stuffed her in the trunk?

78
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,400
The crazy woman?

79
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:49,280
Uh...

80
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,360
Who?

81
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,480
What are you doing?

82
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:06,760
Hardworking people should be rewarded.

83
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:10,160
Your overtime pay will turn into dividends.

84
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:14,080
Your suit will be embroidered with gold thread.

85
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,840
Because from now on,

86
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,040
I'm

87
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,800
your

88
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,680
backing.

89
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,520
But after that party,

90
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,440
everything went out of control

91
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,520
and could not be salvaged.

92
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:04,560
Drink!

93
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,440
Put me down.

94
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,480
I can still drink.

95
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,160
Drink, drink, drink.

96
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,400
Drink them to death, you bastards.

97
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,400
You can't beat me.

98
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,720
Don't go.

99
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,720
You're clearly interested in me.

100
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,640
Aren't you?

101
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:23,880
Qianqian,

102
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:24,840
you're drunk.

103
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,080
Go to bed early.

104
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,000
Qianqian,

105
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:33,520
thank you for inviting me to the party.

106
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:36,000
But I really should go back.

107
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,040
Go back?

108
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:40,200
Go back to Su Muchen?

109
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:41,880
Zhou Jian,

110
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,280
I like you.

111
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:47,880
I know you like me too.

112
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:52,720
When you deleted the surveillance for me,

113
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,520
you were doomed to fall for me.

114
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,840
Divorce Su Muchen.

115
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,920
I can give you more than she can.

116
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,520
I'm sorry.

117
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,520
Why do you need to apologize to me?

118
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:18,120
You don't need to apologize to me.

119
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,680
I'm sorry.

120
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:34,840
I took advantage of your feelings for me

121
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,200
to get to where I am today.

122
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,440
I like you too.

123
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,040
But we can't be together.

124
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,880
I'm already married to Su Muchen.

125
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,360
I love her.

126
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,040
You can get a divorce.

127
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,960
You can love me even if you love her.

128
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,640
Come back!

129
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:16,280
Zhou Jian, come back!

130
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:20,720
Why don't you choose me?

131
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,440
Come back!

132
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,760
Did I let you go?

133
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,920
I'm with you.

134
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,440
When you come back,

135
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:51,120
share more love with me.

136
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:03,600
Lu Qianqian didn't know, did she?

137
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:06,320
She drank a lot that day.

138
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:08,720
Mr. Wu,

139
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,880
make an appointment with Su Muchen for me.

140
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,640
Don't let Zhou Jian know.

141
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:13,880
OK.

142
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:23,000
I saw the hospital test report when I was 15.

143
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:24,520
Lu Qianqian

144
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,960
is not your biological daughter.

145
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:30,160
She has no blood relation with me.

146
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:33,760
The baby can be anyone's,

147
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:36,320
but not yours.

148
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,280
Mom,

149
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,680
I'm begging you.

150
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,600
Please, this is the last time I'm asking.

151
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,200
Just let me do this.

152
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,360
Because you're my son,

153
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:52,440
I've always been lenient with you.

154
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,480
But this time,

155
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,600
I can't.

156
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,760
Ms. An,

157
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,240
over the years,

158
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:23,520
thank you for taking care of my husband.

159
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:27,640
The apartment Zhou Jian rented,

160
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,880
which building is it in?

161
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:32,880
This...

162
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:35,680
This...

163
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:39,840
Ms. An,

164
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,240
what do you mean?

165
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,440
I don't understand.

166
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,040
You can't even find

167
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:48,880
your own home with Zhou Jian.

168
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,600
But my Golden Thread Building

169
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:53,880
can be a landmark

170
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:56,640
no matter where you are in the city.

171
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,960
Just say it.

172
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,600
I know everything about

173
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,880
Zhou Jian and Lu Qianqian.

174
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:07,880
The child of our Lu family

175
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,760
can't be the mistress.

176
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,720
So?

177
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:13,960
So,

178
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,200
you have two choices.

179
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,600
Either take the money and leave the city,

180
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,000
or

181
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:25,400
wait for me to choose your tombstone.

182
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:28,120
I won't divorce Zhou Jian.

183
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,360
Lu Qianqian's baby

184
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,600
is definitely not his.

185
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:37,400
I can give you everything you want,

186
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:43,920
but

187
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,960
you can't give me a home.

188
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,680
Muchen.

189
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:11,400
Su Muchen.

190
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:15,600
I've told you over and over again

191
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,240
many times.

192
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,520
that there are some things you can't handle.

193
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,360
You can't handle them.

194
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,640
Why don't you listen?

195
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,560
Muchen, where are you? Answer the phone.

196
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,040
Do you know how much trouble you've caused?

197
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,160
So you know everything.

198
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:08,200
I know.

199
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,880
Although her death was an accident,

200
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:17,160
it was because Anne pushed her to the edge

201
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:19,840
that she became mentally unstable

202
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:20,680
and got hit by a car.

203
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,040
I've been living like a dog

204
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:25,320
in the Lu family for years,

205
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,400
just for one purpose,

206
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,200
which is to pull down the woman

207
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:30,000
sitting on the throne of power and prestige, just like you.

208
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:33,560
But do you know that my sister was pregnant with your child

209
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,360
before she was hit and died?

210
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,360
It seems you don't know.

211
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:44,040
It was Annie who covered up the truth with lies.

212
00:16:44,560 --> 00:16:47,280
But you chose to remain silent, knowing the truth,

213
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:50,080
becoming an accomplice to her lies,

214
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:55,680
and told a lie that is

215
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,200
harder to be found out.

216
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:12,720
You're really a lady.

217
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:15,040
Even in such a big event,

218
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:17,040
you still dress up so beautifully.

219
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:21,080
Are you Su Muchen's sister?
